This licence covers only the work added to this repository by the FaMAF CVA6
Project:

  - gem5_config_CVA6/      the gem5 configuration matched to CVA6, its
                           calibration harness and sweep, the MinorCPU patch,
                           the benchmark programs on both sides and the paired
                           runs from both sides
  - scripts/               the repository's own drivers, checks and sync tools
  - dockerfiles/           the Docker files used to build the images
  - viewers/FlowCompare.html   the side-by-side comparison viewer, which
                           exists only in this repository
  - README.md and the other documentation written for this fork

  - verilator_changes/     PARTLY, and only the modifications. Both files
                           tracked here, custom_size_vcds/ariane_tb.cpp and
                           custom_size_vcds/Makefile, are modified copies of
                           files belonging to the OpenHW Group and ETH Zurich.
                           The changes made to them are this project's. The
                           files themselves stay under their original Apache
                           2.0 and Solderpad 0.51 terms, and each carries a
                           notice saying what was changed, as those licences
                           require. The unmodified originals are at
                           corev_apu/tb/ariane_tb.cpp and the Makefile at the
                           root of this repository.

It does not cover the CVA6 core or its dependencies, which are the work of the
OpenHW Group and contributors and stay under their original licences: see
LICENSE, LICENSE.Berkeley and LICENSE.SiFive, all preserved here.

The two visualizers under viewers/CVA6Flow and viewers/MinorFlow are git
submodules. They are not part of this repository's tree and carry this same MIT
licence in their own repositories. viewers/FlowCompare.html is not a submodule:
it is a tracked file of this repository and is covered above.

